  "description": "Elegant One-Line Heart with Floral Border\nExperience the epitome of artistic beauty with the “Elegant One-Line Heart with Floral Border” embroidery design. This exquisite motif features a gracefully contoured heart, skillfully rendered in a single uninterrupted line.\nThe heart is delicately adorned by a border of intricate and enchanting flowers, adding a touch of nature’s charm to the design. The combination of the one-line technique and the floral embellishments creates a captivating and romantic image, making it a perfect addition to your creative projects.\nThis machine embroidery design comes with multiple file formats and can be used with various embroidery machines.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Elegant One-Line Heart with Floral Border</p>\n<p>Experience the epitome of artistic beauty with the “Elegant One-Line Heart with Floral Border” embroidery design. This exquisite motif features a gracefully contoured heart, skillfully rendered in a single uninterrupted line.</p>\n<p>The heart is delicately adorned by a border of intricate and enchanting flowers, adding a touch of nature’s charm to the design. The combination of the one-line technique and the floral embellishments creates a captivating and romantic image, making it a perfect addition to your creative projects.</p>\n<p>This machine embroidery design comes with multiple file formats and can be used with various embroidery machines.</p>",
